<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main class="page page-about">
    <%- include('partials/page-banner', {
        title,
        eyebrow: 'About Service Network',
        subtitle: 'We make it easier for volunteers and organizations to find each other, coordinate service, and create lasting community impact.',
        bannerClass: 'page-banner--about'
    }) %>

    <section class="content-intro">
        <h2>Built to make service easier to find</h2>
        <p class="lead">Service Network connects volunteers with organizations that need them. We believe every person has something valuable to contribute, and every community grows stronger when service is easy to discover and simple to join.</p>
        <p>From first-time volunteers to established community groups, we work to remove friction, spotlight trusted opportunities, and help people take the next step from interest to action.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="impact-grid">
        <article class="impact-card">
            <h3>500+ volunteers</h3>
            <p>Connected with projects that match their time, interests, and skills.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="impact-card">
            <h3>80+ service projects</h3>
            <p>Highlighted across environmental, educational, community, and wellness needs.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="impact-card">
            <h3>25+ partner groups</h3>
            <p>Working alongside us to create responsive, people-centered opportunities.</p>
        </article>
    </section>

    <section class="info-grid">
        <article class="info-card">
            <h3>Our Mission</h3>
            <p>We make it simple for individuals, families, and groups to find meaningful volunteer opportunities while helping organizations recruit support for the work they are already doing.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
            <h3>Our Story</h3>
            <p>Service Network began as a small local effort to connect neighbors with nearby projects. It has grown into a broader community resource built around trust, clarity, and meaningful service.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="info-card">
            <h3>How We Help</h3>
            <p>We curate opportunities, communicate expectations, and make sure volunteers can quickly understand where they are needed and how to get involved.</p>
        </article>
    </section>

    <section class="section-panel">
        <h2>Our Values</h2>
        <ul class="content-list">
            <li><strong>Service</strong> - Small acts of service create meaningful change when people show up consistently.</li>
            <li><strong>Community</strong> - Strong neighborhoods are built when people work together toward shared goals.</li>
            <li><strong>Accessibility</strong> - Volunteering should be easy to discover, easy to understand, and easy to join.</li>
            <li><strong>Partnership</strong> - We support the organizations already doing the work on the ground.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="contact-section">
        <div class="contact-copy">
            <h2>Get in Touch</h2>
            <p>Have a question, a project idea, or want to explore a partnership? We would love to hear from you and help you find the right next step.</p>
            <ul class="contact-info">
                <li><strong>Email:</strong> info@servicenetwork.org</li>
                <li><strong>Phone:</strong> (234) 800-123-4567</li>
                <li><strong>Address:</strong> 12 Community Way, Uyo, Akwa Ibom State, Nigeria</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-form-wrap">
            <% if (typeof success !== 'undefined' && success) { %>
                <p class="success-message">Thanks for reaching out - we will get back to you soon.</p>
            <% } %>

            <h3>Send Us a Message</h3>
            <form action="/contact" method="POST">
                <div>
                    <label for="name">Name</label>
                    <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label for="email">Email</label>
                    <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label for="subject">Subject</label>
                    <input type="text" id="subject" name="subject">
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label for="message">Message</label>
                    <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" required></textarea>
                </div>

                <button type="submit">Send Message</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
